NormWear, https://github.com/Mobile-Sensing-and-UbiComp-Laboratory/NormWear,
is distributed by its authors under the Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE in this
folder). This copy keeps only the files used to compute frozen embeddings
(main_model.py and modules/normwear.py, layers.py, pos_embed.py, patch_embed.py).
Changes: the torchaudio import in main_model.py is optional (torchaudio has no
CUDA 13.2 wheel and is not used to compute embeddings), the demonstration block at
the end of main_model.py is removed, and an empty __init__.py makes the folder
importable.
